        "heading": {
          "zh": "產品介紹",
          "en": "Products"
        },
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "label": {
              "zh": "Tocotrienols (三烯生育醇，簡稱T3)",
              "en": "Tocotrienols (T3)"
            },
            "text": {
              "zh": "是維生素E家族中最具生物活性的成員。由澳洲昆士蘭科技大學前列腺頑疾研究中心進行臨床研究證實，T3具有抗頑疾及抑制頑疾幹細胞的作用。其獨特的化學結構使人體細胞攝取效率高達普通維生素E的70倍，並能快速被人體器官吸收利用。",
              "en": "are the most biologically active members of the vitamin E family. Clinical research by the Prostate Cancer Research Centre at Queensland University of Technology confirms that T3 has anti-cancer action and inhibits cancer stem cells. Its distinctive chemical structure gives it a cellular uptake efficiency of up to 70 times that of ordinary vitamin E, and it is rapidly absorbed and used by the body's organs."
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "康草堂T3採用高純度天然提取物，不含常見的Alpha-Tocopherol干擾，確保最大化的抗氧化及免疫調節效益。",
              "en": "Wonder Herb T3 uses high-purity natural extracts, free from Alpha-Tocopherol interference, ensuring maximum antioxidant and immune-modulating benefits."
            }
          }
        ],
        "variant": "group"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text-block",
