            "text": {
              "zh": "比一般合成維生素E高出60倍抗氧化能力，保護細胞免受自由基傷害",
              "en": "60 times the antioxidant capacity of ordinary synthetic vitamin E, protecting cells from free-radical damage"
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "zh": "抑制頑疾進展：",
              "en": "Slows cancer progression:"
            },
            "text": {
              "zh": "有助抑制腫瘤生長，減慢異常細胞擴散和轉移",
              "en": "Helps inhibit tumour growth and slows the spread and metastasis of abnormal cells"
