            "text": {
              "zh": "降低膽固醇，維護心血管及促進代謝健康與脂肪平衡",
              "en": "Lowers cholesterol, protects the cardiovascular system and promotes metabolic health and fat balance"
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "zh": "動脈硬化防護：",
              "en": "Protection against arteriosclerosis:"
            },
            "text": {
              "zh": "對預防動脈硬化有顯著功效",
              "en": "Significantly effective in preventing arteriosclerosis"
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "zh": "造血幹細胞保護：",
              "en": "Haematopoietic stem cell protection:"
            },
            "text": {
              "zh": "有效保護造血幹細胞，防止胃腸道和血管損傷",
              "en": "Effectively protects haematopoietic stem cells and prevents gastrointestinal and vascular damage"
