        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "根據澳洲昆士蘭科技大學發表於國際期刊的研究，T3能夠選擇性誘導頑疾細胞凋亡，同時保護正常細胞。動物實驗顯示，補充T3可顯著降低腫瘤負荷，並改善發炎指標。康草堂T3嚴格遵循高純度標準，確保每一粒軟膠囊均達到研究級活性。",
              "en": "According to studies published by QUT in international journals, T3 selectively induces cancer cell apoptosis while protecting normal cells. Animal studies show that T3 supplementation significantly reduces tumor burden and improves inflammatory markers. Wonder Herb T3 adheres to strict purity standards, ensuring every softgel meets research-grade activity."
